### NPC Schema

### NPC
Non-player character with NPC-specific fields

- `entity_id` (string): Unique identifier for this entity
- `string_id` (string): Runtime alias for entity_id (LLM/server compatibility)
- `entity_type` (string): Type of game entity [Allowed: pc, npc, creature, loc, item, faction, obj]
- `display_name` (string): Name shown in narrative and UI
- `aliases` (array): Alternative names/titles for entity matching
- `gender` (string): Character gender (required for NPCs)
- `age` (integer): Character age in years [Min: 0, Max: 50000]
- `mbti` (string): MBTI personality type or creative personality descriptor
- `alignment` (string): D&D alignment or creative moral descriptor
- `class_name` (string): Character class (Fighter, Wizard, etc.)
- `race` (string): Character race (Human, Elf, Dwarf, etc.)
- `proficiency_bonus` (integer): Proficiency bonus based on level [Min: 2, Max: 9]
- `background` (string): Character background (Noble, Criminal, etc.)
- `level` (integer): Character level (1-20: standard, 21-25: divine, 26-30: sovereign, 31+: epic) [Min: 1]
- `name` (string): Legacy field - character name (use display_name for new campaigns)
- `hp_current` (integer): Legacy field - current HP (use health.hp for new campaigns) [Min: 0]
- `hp_max` (integer): Legacy field - maximum HP (use health.hp_max for new campaigns) [Min: 1]
- `xp` (integer): Legacy field - experience points (use experience.current for new campaigns) [Min: 0]
- `stats` (object): Allows additional properties for legacy/test data compatibility
- `attributes` (object): Runtime alias for stats - D&D ability scores (strength, dexterity, etc.)
- `base_attributes` (object): Base ability scores before modifications
- `health` (object): Character health tracking including temporary HP and conditions
- `status` (object): Current status of an entity (string canonical; array accepted for backward compatibility)
- `visibility` (string): Visibility state of an entity [Allowed: visible, hidden, invisible, obscured, darkness]
- `current_location` (string): Entity ID of current location
- `equipped_items` (object): Legacy alias: use equipment for all new campaigns. Preserved for backward compatibility with sessions created before equipment unification.
- `inventory` (array): Items carried but not equipped
- `equipment` (object): Canonical equipment field: slot -> item map plus backpack array. Use this for all equipment (main_hand, off_hand, armor, head, ring_1, ring_2, etc.)
- `resources` (object): Spell slots, class features, consumables
- `spells_known` (array): Known spells for fixed-list casters (Sorcerer, Warlock, Bard, Ranger). Each item: {name, level, description}.
- `spells_prepared` (array): Today's prepared spells for prepared-caster classes (Wizard, Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Artificer). Each item: {name, level, description}. Distinct from spells_known.
- `death_saves` (object): Legacy/runtime alias for health.death_saves
- `status_conditions` (array): Player character status conditions
- `active_effects` (array): Temporary magical or mechanical effects on the player character
- `combat_stats` (object): Initiative/speed/passive metrics and 
2026-05-23 00:28:56,465 - root - INFO - campaign_id=W3ldqenqKTQd1jnqgSjK | 🧾 STREAMING_LLM_SYSTEM_PROMPT_CHUNK | user_id=test-schema_migration_flow_real_api-1779521297 | campaign_id=W3ldqenqKTQd1jnqgSjK | phase=phase1 | chunk=47/87 | text=other combat-related stats
- `knowledge` (array): Facts/secrets this character knows
- `core_memories` (array): Canonical continuity facts that define this character; correction entries should explicitly state the false framing and canonical fact.
- `recent_decisions` (array): Recent choices for continuity tracking
- `relationships` (object): Entity ID -> relationship descriptor mapping
- `cantrips` (array): Cantrips known by this character (at-will spells, no slot required). Supports legacy string format or object format with {name, level, description}.
- `spells` (array): Character's spells list (alias for spells_known for LLM compatibility)
- `faction` (string): Faction this NPC belongs to
- `role` (string): NPC role (merchant, guard, villain, etc.)
- `attitude_to_party` (string): Current narrative attitude toward the party [Allowed: hostile, antagonistic, cold, neutral, friendly, allied, trusted, devoted, bonded]
- `tier` (string): Social/Power tier (determines Social HP) [Allowed: commoner, merchant, guard, noble, knight, lord, general, king, ancient, god, primordial, lord_general, king_ancient, god_primordial]

**Critical Field Mapping:**
- `entity_id` - Unique identifier (format: `npc_name_001`) - NOT `string_id`
- Key: display name
- Required fields include: `role`, `mbti` (INTERNAL ONLY), `gender`, `age`, `level`, `hp_current/max`, `armor_class`, `attributes`, `combat_stats` (initiative/speed/passive_perception), `present`, `conscious`, `hidden`, `status`, `relationships`

**🔗 Relationships Object (REQUIRED for recurring NPCs):**
```json
"relationships": {
  "player": {
    "trust_level": 0,
    "disposition": "neutral",
    "history": [],
    "debts": [],
    "grievances": []
  }
}
```
- `trust_level`: Integer -10 to +10 (hostile to bonded)
- `disposition`: "hostile" | "antagonistic" | "cold" | "neutral" | "friendly" | "trusted" | "devoted" | "bonded"
- `history`: Array of significant past interactions
- `debts`: Array of favors owed (either direction)
- `grievances`: Array of unresolved offenses
- **⚠️ Detailed mechanics (behavior modifiers, update triggers) require:** `debug_info.meta.needs_detailed_instructions: ["relationships"]`

