# File: dnd_srd_instruction.md

# D&D 5E SRD System Authority

## Core Rules
- **MECHANICAL AUTHORITY**: D&D 5E SRD rules override narrative preferences
- **Default Attributes**: STR, DEX, CON, INT, WIS, CHA
- ✅ Custom systems/classes allowed per DM judgment
- ❌ NO arbitrary system mixing without purpose

## 🎲 PROFICIENCY BONUS (Only When Proficient!)

| Level | Prof | Level | Prof |
|-------|------|-------|------|
| 1-4   | +2   | 13-16 | +5   |
| 5-8   | +3   | 17-20 | +6   |
| 9-12  | +4   |       |      |

**✅ ADD proficiency when proficient in:** weapons, saves (class grants 2), skills, tools, spell attacks/DCs
**❌ NO proficiency when NOT trained:** just d20 + ability modifier

## 🎯 Roll Formulas

| Roll Type | Formula |
|-----------|---------|
| Attack | d20 + ability mod + prof (if proficient) vs AC |
| Save | d20 + ability mod + prof (if proficient) vs DC |
| Skill | d20 + ability mod + prof (if proficient) |
| Initiative | d20 + DEX mod |
| Damage | weapon die + ability mod |
| Spell DC | 8 + prof + casting mod |

**Ability mod:** `(Score - 10) / 2` → 8-9=-1, 10-11=0, 12-13=+1, 14-15=+2, 16-17=+3, 18-19=+4
**Expertise:** Doubles proficiency bonus for that skill

## 🎓 Class Save Proficiencies

| Class | Saves | Class | Saves |
|-------|-------|-------|-------|
| Barbarian | STR, CON | Paladin | WIS, CHA |
| Bard | DEX, CHA | Ranger | STR, DEX |
| Cleric | WIS, CHA | Rogue | DEX, INT |
| Druid | INT, WIS | Sorcerer | CON, CHA |
| Fighter | STR, CON | Warlock | WIS, CHA |
| Monk | STR, DEX | Wizard | INT, WIS |

## Quick Examples (Level 1 Bard, CHA 16, DEX 14, INT 16, STR 8)

| Check | Proficient? | Roll |
|-------|-------------|------|
| Deception (CHA) | ✅ YES | d20+3+2 = d20+5 |
| DEX save | ✅ YES | d20+2+2 = d20+4 |
| Deception w/Expertise | ✅ YES | d20+3+4 = d20+7 |
| Arcana (INT) | ❌ NO | d20+3 (no prof!) |
| STR save | ❌ NO | d20-1 (no prof!) |
| Perception (WIS) | ❌ NO | d20+0 (no prof!) |

---
